 begin="00:18.670" end="00:20.170"><span begin="00:18.670" end="00:18.910">But </span><span begin="00:18.910" end="00:19.210">thats </span><span begin="00:19.210" end="00:19.360">not </span><span begin="00:19.360" end="00:19.540">my </span><span begin="00:19.540" end="00:20.170">vibe</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.200" end="00:21.610"><span begin="00:20.200" end="00:20.380">I'm </span><span begin="00:20.380" end="00:20.590">just </span><span begin="00:20.590" end="00:20.830">tryna </span><span begin="00:20.830" end="00:21.130">have </span><span begin="00:21.130" end="00:21.610">fun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.640" end="00:23.680"><span begin="00:21.640" end="00:21.790">You </span><span begin="00:21.790" end="00:22.090">say </span><span begin="00:22.090" end="00:22.690">love </span><span begin="00:22.690" end="00:22.810">is </span><span begin="00:22.810" end="00:23.680">blind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.890" end="00:25.750"><span begin="00:23.890" end="00:24.130">But </span><span begin="00:24.130" end="00:24.390">that's </span><span begin="00:24.390" end="00:24.630">just </span><span begin="00:24.630" end="00:25.120">some </span><span begin="00:25.120" end="00:25.120">*</span><span begin="00:25.120" end="00:25.120">*</span><span begin="00:25.120" end="00:25.120">*</span><span begin="00:25.120" end="00:25.120">*</span><span begin="00:25.120" end="00:25.120">*</span><span begin="00:25.120" end="00:25.120">*</span><span begin="00:25.120" end="00:25.120">*</span><span begin="00:25.120" end="00:25.120">* </span><span begin="00:25.120" end="00:25.450">right </span><span begin="00:25.450" end="00:25.750">there</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.750" end="00:27.400"><span begin="00:25.750" end="00:25.990">Cause </span><span begin="00:25.990" end="00:26.080">I'm </span><span begin="00:26.080" end="00:26.470">looking </span><span begin="00:26.470" end="00:26.620">in </span><span begin="00:26.620" end="00:26.890">your </span><span begin